<title>UKRAINE: SOCCER-SHAKHTAR DONETSK WIN UKRAINIAN CUP.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SHAKHTAR DONETSK WIN UKRAINIAN CUP.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-05-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shakhtar Donetsk beat Dnipro Dnipropetrovsk 1-0 (halftime 1-0) in the final of the Ukraine Cup on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Serhiy Atelkin 37</p>
<p>Attendance: 30,000</p>
